# synstudio effect
name    greenscreen
label   Green screen
group   Key
about   Pulls green out of the picture and leaves it transparent, so whatever
about   is on the track below shows through
alpha   1
param   similarity  0.2   0.01  1  Similarity
param   blend       0.05  0     1  Blend
filter  [$in]format=rgba,chromakey=color=0x00b140:similarity=$similarity:
filter  blend=$blend[$out]
